WEBVTT

00:12:58.815 --> 00:13:00.046
Most of all, though,

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:04.411
we need to talk about what's already
happening today around the world

00:13:04.435 --> 00:13:06.363
and what could happen in the future.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.434
Now, I live in Texas,

00:13:08.458 --> 00:13:12.799
and Texas has the highest carbon emissions
of any state in the United States.

00:13:12.823 --> 00:13:15.736
You might say, "Well,
what can you talk about in Texas?"

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.767
The answer is: a lot.

00:13:18.601 --> 00:13:23.405
Did you know that in Texas
there's over 25,000 jobs

00:13:23.429 --> 00:13:24.796
in the wind energy industry?

00:13:25.315 --> 00:13:28.379
We are almost up to 20 percent
of our electricity

00:13:28.403 --> 00:13:30.768
from clean, renewable sources,
most of that wind,